# wear/man/kaftan: the man's kaftan (the Dune men): a long coat worn open over a linen under-robe, its front edges, collar
# and hem trimmed in the trim colour, a sash of the second cloth tied over both at the waist; to the ankles (kaftan_hang),
# wide trimmed sleeves (robe_sleeve_*). The trims are the garment's edge (a border or embroidery recolours them).
# GARB-M (P2b wave 2); fitted to the man (STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person woman
legend Z linen 4
legend T pattern 2
legend U pattern 3
body man
role garment kaftan
layer torso
anchor neck
keys torso

